# THE REACH HALF -- 14 sites where an INT-KEYED table is probed, over 150 files discovered by os.walk under checks/ + gates/
## LIVE    : a bool EXPRESSION indexes the table, no guard at all            : 0
## LATENT  : a non-bool expression indexes it, no guard -- LIVE the moment a caller passes a comparison : 11
## GUARDED : an isinstance(x, bool) protecting the site, earlier-line OR same-expression : 3

